  [00:59:11.024797] acquire_lock Code 200 / succeeded     <-- the TTL expired, it got the lock back
  [00:59:11.024864] energy_saving_app.cpp:883 run_switch_cycle_once] There is switch powering on/off, skip...
  and it does NOT release the lock on that path, so it squats routing_lock for another full
  TTL while doing nothing, forever. Livelock, not deadlock.
